    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar farm. A friendly supervisor. A rift in the sky. An evolving basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up without memory of who, what, when or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/4aed258fef78a43d7c9bc3e7f4651d17.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground basement changes, and is never quite the same when you return to it. Supposedly the basement connects to a forest, if you can find your way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/e55b6a3141f5b28023762a1c704ac14f.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When inside the basement, be wary of any critters and curiosities. They may look cute, but not all of them want you near them and may retaliate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/9e9d444e845c67dd78fe824d85571401.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather seeds, grow crops, craft items, and solve puzzles in order to complete the tasks given by your friendly supervisor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar farm. A friendly supervisor. A rift in the sky. An evolving basement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up without memory of who, what, when or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/4aed258fef78a43d7c9bc3e7f4651d17.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground basement changes, and is never quite the same when you return to it. Supposedly the basement connects to a forest, if you can find your way there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/e55b6a3141f5b28023762a1c704ac14f.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When inside the basement, be wary of any critters and curiosities. They may look cute, but not all of them want you near them and may retaliate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665830/extras/9e9d444e845c67dd78fe824d85571401.avif?t=1754042680\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather seeds, grow crops, craft items, and solve puzzles in order to complete the tasks given by your friendly supervisor.</p>",
